# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. Only the compliance evaluator (`deployctl review`) reads
# these — they are OPTIONAL: with them unset, the review still runs, it just isn't traced.
#
# The evaluator's AI brief runs on the Claude Code CLI (`claude -p`) using your SUBSCRIPTION, not
# an Anthropic API key (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is deliberately stripped from the call). Each call is
# sent to Langfuse as one generation so prompts, completions, tokens, cost, and latency are
# observable.
#
# Use a Langfuse project DEDICATED to deployment-platform so its traces never mix with another
# product's. Create one at your Langfuse host → New project → Create API keys.
LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY=
LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY=
# Region host: https://cloud.langfuse.com (EU), https://us.cloud.langfuse.com (US),
# https://jp.cloud.langfuse.com (JP).
LANGFUSE_BASE_URL=https://cloud.langfuse.com
# Set to 0 to send only metrics (tokens/cost/latency) and NOT the prompt + completion text.
LANGFUSE_CAPTURE_IO=1
